    <div class="hws-cta-inner">
      <h2>Add your voice</h2>
      <p>Tell Islington Council what a Holloway Women's Centre would mean to you.</p>
      <a href="https://levelup.yourmovement.org/p/share-your-thoughts-holloway-womens-centre" class="hws-btn-primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Share your thoughts &rarr;</a>
