      <a href="/active-campaigns/islington-council-finish-holloway-womens-centre" class="hws-back-link">&larr; Back to the Holloway campaign</a>
      <a href="https://levelup.yourmovement.org/p/islington-council-finish-holloway-womens-centre" class="hws-btn-outline" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Sign the petition</a>
